        <mxCell id="c120" value="&lt;i&gt;Rows 1 and 2, which hold the title, are scrolled out of view. Selected: D5, whose formula shows in the bar. Outlined: the three accounts that exceed the invoice lines, 4010, 4020 and 4040. Each difference equals one of the three invoices below, which the ledger posted on 2026-01-01, so nothing is left unexplained.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="442" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
